  "description": "Verify that a customer can enter a promotional coupon code on the Cart page, the system validates coupon eligibility based on the product subtotal before shipping, applies the appropriate discount without exceeding the subtotal, recalculates the cart totals, and displays the applied coupon details and updated discount amount in the Cart page UI.",
  "priority": "critical",
